stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> ready
  ready --> active
  active --> in_review : in-review
  in_review --> done
  active --> done
  ready --> paused
  active --> paused
  paused --> active
  done --> [*] : archived date plus move

  note right of done
    Written by a person, never derived.
    A story whose plans have all delivered may still be active.
  end note
